# A walk to a NAMED entity: the literal is compared on the reached entity's key.
rule fixture.in-group v0.1
says "The holder has a claim whose code falls under the watched group."
subject holder
collection claims : claim    for subject via holder
collection groups : code-isa
closure in-group over groups from child to parent
conclude InGroup when
  some claim c in claims
  require c.code in-group watched
